    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Narrative-Based Racing Game has you competing for more than just victory; uncover this grand mystery through eccentric characters and champion each course in Time Trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themes Across Space and Time: This cast is themed around many time periods throughout human history and beyond, including those still a mystery to this day. Each theme is represented not only in a character but in specialized tracks and vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Brought You Here?: The secrets behind this time-napping are uncovered with each victory, unveiling a piece of the puzzle and more to remember who was chosen and why. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the Champion of Their Challenge: Championships unlock new tracks to test your skills by accomplishing the fastest time possible with any of the Chosen Few.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Narrative-Based Racing Game has you competing for more than just victory; uncover this grand mystery through eccentric characters and champion each course in Time Trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themes Across Space and Time: This cast is themed around many time periods throughout human history and beyond, including those still a mystery to this day. Each theme is represented not only in a character but in specialized tracks and vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What Brought You Here?: The secrets behind this time-napping are uncovered with each victory, unveiling a piece of the puzzle and more to remember who was chosen and why. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the Champion of Their Challenge: Championships unlock new tracks to test your skills by accomplishing the fastest time possible with any of the Chosen Few.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Taken from their time, send these Chosen Few back home by championing the Grand Prix and piece together the mystery behind their kidnapping.",
